      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعْرِبٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرِيبٌ</span>, in two places: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرَابٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also One <i>who has horses of pure Arabian race:</i> (S, O:) one <i>who has with him a horse
